# ref_id = Matthew 6:31
# eng_text = Therefore don't be anxious , saying , ' What will we eat ? ' , ' What will we drink ? ' or , ' With what will we be clothed ? '
# xav_text = Aimama 'wa hã hâiwa ãma 're ĩsãmra mono ma hã , tãma aiwaihu'u pese za'ra wa'aba di , marĩ zô aiwi 're ĩrowaptâ'â za'ra wa'aba mono zém na hã . Taha wa , marĩ na asina 're aihâtâ'â za'ra wa'aba mono õ di za . Ãté asina 're aihâtâ'â za'ra wa'aba mono wa , te za ãne asima 're ĩrosa'rata za'ra wa'aba mono zéb zarina , ãne asima 're ĩnharĩ za'ra wa'aba mo : “ E ma hawi te za mra hã wama 're wairébé , duré wa te 're ĩ'âhuri mono zéb da hã , duré wa'uzazéb da hã . ” Ãne na asima 're rosa'rata za'ra wa'aba mono õ di za . 'Re ĩhâimana u'âsi mono waihu'u'õ'wa norĩ hã , taha zô si te sima 're sõpré , sina 're hâtâ'â za'ra mono wa .
