# eng_text = Now there were with us seven brothers . The first married and died , and having no seed left his wife to his brother .
# xav_text = Tawamhã Zezusihi ma , te duré rowasu'u za'ra , ãne : — Dasisãnawã si 're ĩhâimana za'ra mono norĩ wasu'u hã wa za oto aima wasu'u za'ra ni . Ta norĩ wasu'u hã wa te waihu'u za'ra da , wa za ãma asadanharĩ za'ra ni za . Dasisãnawã si hã ma tô wasiré 're si'ubumro aré , wasiré zudezu norĩ hã 7 na ĩhâiba za'ra hã , aibâ norĩ hã . Tawamhã ĩpoto'rada hã ma tô timro . Mro nherẽ , ti'ra hã sisõ'a ré te te 'maipoto õ ré , ma tô dârâ . Taha wa , ĩ'uirĩ na ma tô ĩsõsi hã ãma timro tizédé'aba mro na , Mozésihi nhimi'ui'éré zarina .
