# sent_id = 45014010
# ref_id = Romans 14:10
# eng_text = But you , why do you judge your brother ? Or you again , why do you despise your brother ? For we will all stand before the judgment seat of Christ .
# xav_text = Tane nherẽ , e marĩ wa , te bété asisãnawã norĩ hã 're ĩwẽ'õ za'ra wa'aba mo , asiré ĩsazei'wa 're anomro aba mono nherẽ . E marĩ wa , te 're ĩ'ruiwapari u'âsi za'ra wa'aba mo , asisãnawã nherẽ . Niwapsi wa za uburé 'Re ĩhâimana u'âsi mono nho're aimasam ni , te te wa'awaihu'u da , wahâimana wẽ na , wahâimana wasété na zama . Tamep si za te te da'awẽ'õ na dâ'âsina , asi'uihâ na 're asiwẽ'õ pese za'ra wa'aba mono õ di za , ti'ab ré .
